sequenceDiagram
    participant script as eval_msmarco.py
    participant MS as MS MARCO Dataset<br/>(8.8M passages, HuggingFace)
    participant RS as Reservoir Sampler
    participant idx as Indexer
    participant CDB as ChromaDB
    participant eval as MRR@10 Evaluator

    script->>MS: Stream passages (never load all 8.8M into RAM)
    MS-->>script: passage batches

    script->>RS: Reservoir sample — guarantee all qrel-relevant passages included
    Note over RS: Algorithm: if slot available → insert<br/>else replace random slot with prob k/n<br/>Ensures relevant passages survive sampling
    RS-->>script: 1,100,000 passages (representative subset)

    script->>idx: embed_and_index(1.1M passages)
    idx->>CDB: Store all 1.1M embeddings (HNSW index)

    script->>MS: Load 6,980 official dev queries + qrels
    MS-->>script: [(query_id, query_text, relevant_passage_ids), ...]

    loop For each of 6,980 queries
        script->>CDB: search(query_embedding, top_k=10)
        CDB-->>script: [ranked passage_ids]
        script->>eval: compare ranked list vs qrels
        eval->>eval: reciprocal_rank = 1/rank_of_first_relevant<br/>(0 if not in top 10)
    end

    eval-->>script: MRR@10 = mean(reciprocal_ranks) = 0.585
    Note over eval: BM25 baseline = 0.167<br/>This system: 3.5× above keyword search
